Knowledge Foundry — Licence

DOCUMENTATION AND DIAGRAMS
The Knowledge Foundry Reference Architecture — all documentation and diagrams
published on knowledgefoundry.org — is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).

You are free to share and adapt this material, including for commercial
purposes, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and
indicate if changes were made.

  Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
  Summary:         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

ATTRIBUTION / CITATION
  Knowledge Foundry Reference Architecture (Public Review Release 0.1),
  knowledgefoundry.org.
Individual documents may be cited by their KF code and version
(e.g. "KF-1000 Canon, v0.1").

NAME AND MARKS
"Knowledge Foundry" and its associated names and marks are NOT licensed under
CC BY 4.0. They are governed separately so that no implementation may imply
endorsement or falsely claim conformance. You may state that an implementation
is "inspired by", "implements elements of", or "conforms to" a named version of
Knowledge Foundry, provided the claim is accurate.

CODE, SCHEMAS AND TEMPLATES
Any software, schemas or templates released in future will carry their own
appropriate open-source licence, stated at the point of release.

STATUS
This licensing position is part of a Public Review Release and is subject to
legal review before it is considered settled. See the Open Architecture page at
knowledgefoundry.org for current governance terms.
